# Full-resolution photo originals (6000x4000 JPG/PNG, ~210 MB).
# Every page uses the WebP derivatives written by optimize_images.py, and
# vercel.json 308-redirects each original URL to its largest derivative, so
# old links and image-search results keep working. Keep the originals in
# git; just don't upload them with every deploy. When optimize_images.py picks
# up a new photo, add its original here and a matching redirect in vercel.json.

# Repo tooling that has no business being served as a public file.
optimize_images.py
mobile_menu.py

